==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|es|manzanillo}}, from {{m|es|manzana||apple}}, from {{der|en|la|[[malum]] [[Matianum]]||a kind of apple}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[tropical]] [[American]] [[tree]] ({{taxlink|Hippomane mancinella|species}}), having [[apple]]-[[like]], [[poisonous]] [[fruit]], and a [[sap]] that causes [[blister]]s on [[contact]] with the [[skin]].
#: {{syn|en|beach apple|manchineel tree}}

